	(text_box "TPS26600: I_LIM ≈ 12 A·kΩ / R_ILIM → 7.5k ≈ 1.6 A (JST PH: 2 A per contact).\nt_dVdT = 8e3 · V_IN · C_dVdT → 22 nF ≈ 3.5 ms at 20 V, 4.9 ms at 28 V.\nIMON: 78 µA/A into 18k → 1.4 V/A (2.2 V at the limit), 1k + 10 nF to the ESP32's ADC.\nSHDN: 100k to GND (row off), ROW_EN through 10k → 3.0 V (the datasheet's SHDN range is 0–4 V).\nThe firmware holds ROW_EN with the ESP32's GPIO hold, so a controller reset leaves the rows as they were.\nFLT: open drain, 100k to 3.3 V for the controller; the red LED (680 Ω) lights while it is low.\nUVLO / OVP / MODE to GND: internal 15 V / 33 V thresholds, current-limit mode, auto-retry."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
